            "reloaded_rendered_text": "On 10 March 2025 a care home could place an emergency order by telephoning the supplying pharmacy (a verbal emergency order), then completing the order-book entry retrospectively within 24 hours with the registered manager countersigning it as required; the worked example shows a senior carer phoning the pharmacy, arranging Saturday delivery and completing the paperwork when the registered manager next signed. Alternatively, where a genuinely urgent clinical need arose outside pharmacy hours, the on\u2011call registered manager could authorise sourcing a single dose from a partner site's stock, recording the transfer in both sites' order books and reconciling it at the next stock count.\nTemporal basis: 10 March 2025; version d2b1d0e8-4a8c-4921-8403-a40924273b27; effective 2023-06-01T00:00:00+00:00 to 2025-10-01T00:00:00+00:00 (end exclusive).",
